{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":3,"author":{"id":"625d4f81fd78f1510c65762d99779f95c491087f"},"timestamp":1464378651,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyMjIzODIyNw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/478#issuecomment-222238227"},"message":"Yaroslav Halchenko wrote:\n\n\u003e Related references for git-annex discussion: annex does support concurrent\n\u003e output now https://git-annex.branchable.com/todo/parallel_get/\n\u003e @joeyh - do you think it would be possible to somehow make annex calls report\n\u003e progress on downloads back to parent process somehow, now that you are tracking\n\u003e /reporting progress yourself while in -J mode? (note that even -J1 makes annex\n\u003e report progress on its own shushing wget )\n\u003e Even though we do report back from our custom downloaders back to annex about\n\u003e progress, I am afraid it wouldn't be sufficient due to\n\nThe --json output could include progress info in it somehow, possibly.\n\nOr, a flag could enable some other progress reporting, perhaps to a\nseparate FD. I'm clearer on how this would work, and it could use the\nsame format as the special remote protocol does, so it like it a bit\nmore.\n\nI think that datalad would have to be responsible for propigating that\nprogress info from the subsidiary git-annex to the parent git-annex when\nit's doing that kind of nested download.\n\nNote that git-annex updates .git/annex/transfer/ files for keys\nbeing downloaded with progress info. This is used by some things\nincluding the webapp.\n\n## \n\nsee shy jo","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1465505779,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIyNTAyMzg0Mg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/478#issuecomment-225023842"},"message":"Just an interesting (to me) note that apparently that is how also apt-get interacts with dpkg, where dpkg reports status updates to an fd (passed on cmdline):\n\n```\n$\u003e grep -r status.*fd -A2 .\n./main.c:\"  --status-fd \u003cn\u003e            Send status change updates to file descriptor \u003cn\u003e.\\n\"\n--\n./main.c:  { \"status-fd\",         0,   1, NULL,          NULL,      set_pipe, 0 },\n--\n./help.c:  statusfd_send(\"processing: %s: %s\", action,\n./help.c-                pkgbin_name(pkg, pkgbin, pnaw_nonambig));\n./help.c-}\n--\n./configure.c:  statusfd_send(\"status: %s : %s : '%s' '%s' %i %i \",\n./configure.c-                cfgfile, \"conffile-prompt\",\n./configure.c-                realold, realnew, useredited, distedited);\n--\n./errors.c:  statusfd_send(\"status: %s : %s : %s\", pkgname, \"error\", emsg);\n--\n./errors.c:  statusfd_send(\"status: %s : %s : %s\", filename, \"error\", emsg);\n```","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1467743627,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzMDU2MzQ0Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/478#issuecomment-230563447"},"message":"TODO within annex:  http://git-annex.branchable.com/todo/interface_to_the___34__progress__34___of_annex_operations/","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1474684588,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0OTM0MDIwMQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/478#issuecomment-249340201"},"message":"note that @joeyh joey has done it already! ;)\n\n``` shell\n$\u003e git annex version\ngit-annex version: 6.20160923+gitgd1dabb3-1~ndall+1\n\n$\u003e git annex get -J3 --json --json-progress 10*\n{\"command\":\"get\",\"note\":\"checksum...\",\"success\":true,\"key\":\"SHA256E-s15530--fd99a77abcb4bbb7242123b43ba9784ba76af33f06d3c30300a69fd9541670eb.nii.gz\",\"file\":\"1003/13874.nii.gz\"}\n{\"command\":\"get\",\"note\":\"checksum...\",\"success\":true,\"key\":\"SHA256E-s18347--767e77208e4e5c9e8739e17e99be963528cdb58876d93d6da58fbb41c1627b34.nii.gz\",\"file\":\"1003/13876.